After updating the Go libraries, update this list and the license texts. The modules that end
up in the program are listed by:
  go list -deps -f '{{with .Module}}{{.Path}}@{{.Version}}{{end}}' ./cmd/ssh-app | sort -u
The test web/lizenzen_test.go fails if a license text is missing or the license page does not
link it.
